{"unit_id":"charrywhite__dsh-sticky-notes#feature-1","repo":"charrywhite/dsh-sticky-notes","commit":"1d6fb7553f3b3a367e0652db14f12c2d5292e6bc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sticky-notes 的功能「模型读取便签」：模型调用 sticky_notes_read 后可查看便签标题、文字条目、完成状态、皮肤和折叠状态；图片便签只返回元数据，不展示图片内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:148-185"]}
{"unit_id":"charrywhite__dsh-sticky-notes#feature-2","repo":"charrywhite/dsh-sticky-notes","commit":"1d6fb7553f3b3a367e0652db14f12c2d5292e6bc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sticky-notes 的功能「模型追加待办」：模型调用 sticky_notes_add 可新建文字便签或向已有文字便签追加待办；不能通过该工具覆盖或删除已有内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:188-240"]}
{"unit_id":"charrywhite__dsh-sticky-notes#feature-3","repo":"charrywhite/dsh-sticky-notes","commit":"1d6fb7553f3b3a367e0652db14f12c2d5292e6bc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sticky-notes 的功能「管理面板便签」：用户可在 DSH Web 面板创建文字或图片便签，编辑、勾选、删除条目，调整皮肤、拖动位置或收起便签。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:479-583"]}
{"unit_id":"charrywhite__dsh-sticky-notes#feature-4","repo":"charrywhite/dsh-sticky-notes","commit":"1d6fb7553f3b3a367e0652db14f12c2d5292e6bc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sticky-notes 的功能「保存并同步便签」：浏览器向主机上传便签状态，面板读取主机数据并轮询版本变化；主机将状态写入 ~/.dsh/sticky-notes.json。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:100-140"]}
